================================================================================
CAMPUS COIN - SOFTWARE REQUIREMENTS SPECIFICATION SUBMISSION DOCUMENT
Theme: NextGen BudgetBee | Category: End-to-End Web Solutions
================================================================================

PROJECT OVERVIEW:
CampusCoin is a lightweight, student-first Web Application designed for college and 
university students to log income and expenses, view spending by category, track budget 
caps, receive smart savings guidance, generate monthly PDF reports, and provide full 
administrator oversight.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
1. TECHNOLOGY STACK
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
FRONTEND:
- Framework: React (SPA with Vite)
- Design System: Custom Vanilla CSS (Frosted Glassmorphism, Dark/Light Theme Engine, Text Font Scaler Accessibility)
- Data Visualization: Chart.js & react-chartjs-2 (Category Doughnut & 6-Month Income vs Expense Bar Chart)
- Icons & Badging: Custom Vector SVG Category Badges (`CategoryIcon.jsx`)
- Export Engine: html2canvas & jsPDF (High-Resolution PDF Monthly Financial Report Export)

BACKEND (PHP & NODE REST API):
- PHP Backend: `php-backend/api.php` (PHP REST API for PHP web server deployments)
- Node/Express Backend: `server/server.js` (Express REST API Server on port 5000)
- SQL Script: `campuscoin.sql` (Complete MySQL Database Schema & Table Definitions)

