3. INSTALLATION & RUNNING INSTRUCTIONS
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
STEP 1: Open Terminal in the project directory:
   cd c:\Users\std\Desktop\techwiz

STEP 2: Start the application development server:
   npm run dev

STEP 3: Open browser at http://localhost:3000

PHP BACKEND DEPLOYMENT (OPTIONAL):
- Copy `php-backend/api.php` and import `campuscoin.sql` into your MySQL / XAMPP / WAMP server.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
4. ASSUMPTIONS MADE
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
1. Financial entries represent student-reported manual income & expense logs without direct banking credentials.
2. Smart Auto-Categorization uses pattern-matching rules tailored to student lifestyle routines.
3. System default categories are editable by campus administrators while personal categories can be added/deleted by students.

